2Ch 28:1 , Ahaz reigning very wickedly, is greatly afflicted by the Syrians;
2Ch 28:6 , Judah being captivated by the Israelites, is sent home by the counsel of Oded the prophet;
2Ch 28:16 , Ahaz sending for aid to Assyria, is not helped thereby;
2Ch 28:22 , In his distress he grows more idolatrous;
2Ch 28:26 , He dying, Hezekiah succeeds him.
